        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 258SQT, Downtown Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Kwikset Downtown Deadbolt is available in 5 popular finish choices and has been designed not only to look great, but also to be easy to install. It will fit most pre-drilled doors. It is adjustable to fit doors 1-3/8 inches through 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis <b>Smartkey</b> Kwikset Lock offers convenience and security. It allows you to re-key the lock yourself without removing from the door; this mean you will be able to key all your SmartKey locks to one Kwikset key. Smartkey Deadbolts offer the highest grade of  security with a standard ANSI/BHMA Grade 1 Cylinder. It is pick resistant and bump proof.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The Kwikset Downtown Deadbolt is thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. It features a Kwikset SmartKey security lock cylinder and 1\" throw steel bolt. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/uptown-deadbolt-kwikset-258rdt\"><b>Kwikset 258RDT Round Uptown Deadbolt</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Downtown Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A fully adjustable latch & deadbolt to fit all standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.36 Grade 1 Security</li>\r\n<li>Meets ADA/ANSI A117.1 requirements, ensuring accessibility to all disabled persons</li>\r\n<li>Patented side locking bar technology offers improved security by protecting against lock bumping, an attack technique used to defeat conventional pin & tumbler locks.</li>\r\n<li>Kwikset SmartKey lock cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>ADA compliant interior turn piece.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime mechanical and finish warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Kwikset Downtown Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 2-5/8\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable  2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt: 1\" Throw Steel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
